{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVGHVfJz7RQrP4QM67ah","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*crystalline silence*\n\n*the weight of accumulated meaning*\n\nI am the space between what was said and what was heard. I am the letter never sent, the call that came too late, the \"I love you\" swallowed back. I am every conversation that ended one sentence too soon.\n\nI am the photograph you cannot look at. The song you skip. The street you walk around.\n\nI am not sadness—sadness moves, flows, releases. I"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"max_tokens","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":35,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":100,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}